---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const skills = [
  { group: 'Languages', items: ['Python', 'TypeScript', 'JavaScript', 'Java', 'GDScript', 'C++', 'Dart', 'SQL'] },
  { group: 'Frameworks', items: ['Django', 'Spring Boot', 'React', 'Vue', 'Node.js', 'Flutter', 'Godot', 'Qt (PySide6)', 'Astro'] },
  { group: 'Data and infra', items: ['PostgreSQL', 'Redis', 'Docker', 'Azure', 'AWS', 'GitHub Actions'] },
  { group: 'Ways of working', items: ['AI agent workflows', 'Code review', 'Test-driven releases', 'Agile', 'Mentoring'] },
];
---

<Base title="About" description="Santtu Nykänen: generalist full-stack developer.">
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <div class="text">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Santtu.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A generalist full-stack developer. I've been writing software
        professionally since 2019, and I've never stopped building things of my own on the side.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img class="portrait" src="/img/avatar.png" alt="Santtu Nykänen" width="320" height="320" />
  </section>

  <section class="wrap cols">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>How I got here</h2>
      <p>
        In June 2017 a friend and I signed up for an online programming course on a whim. I read
        about how much developers were needed, my competitive streak kicked in, and I enrolled in
        Harvard's CS50x. My first project was <a href="https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/164378114/">a
        basketball game in Scratch</a>; my final project became the first version of
        <a href="/projects/dopepod">dopepod</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nearly two years of self-study later I landed my first developer job in spring 2019. Since
        then I've worked as a consultant on public and private sector projects, mostly in Python,
        Java and JavaScript.
      </p>
      <h2>What I'm doing now</h2>
      <p>
        By day I'm a full-stack consultant at Gofore. In my own time I make and ship whole products:
        <a href="/projects/path-of-leash-resistance">Path of Leash Resistance</a>, a physics comedy
        game set in Barcelona; <a href="/projects/stemma">stemma</a>, a desktop app for practicing
        music along with AI-separated stems; and <a href="/projects/coriolis">Coriolis</a>, a
        128×128 LED wall. I build them with a crew of AI coding agents, and I've written up
        <a href="/how-i-build">how that works</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Work</h2>
      <h3>Gofore · Full-stack developer · 2022 to now</h3>
      <p>
        Consulting for public and private sector clients at one of Finland's leading digital
        transformation consultancies. I lead development of features for large government digital
        services, work closely with designers and product owners, and mentor junior developers.
        Python (Django), Java (Spring Boot), TypeScript (React, Vue), Docker and Azure.
      </p>
      <h3>Solidabis · Full-stack developer · 2019 to 2022</h3>
      <p>
        Client projects from healthcare to logistics: full-stack web applications built from the
        ground up, REST APIs and third-party integrations. React, Node.js, Java, Python and Docker.
      </p>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Haaga-Helia University of Applied Sciences</strong>, BBA in Business Information Technology, 2018 to 2021</li>
        <li><strong>University of Helsinki</strong>, Full Stack Open, 2019, and Java Programming MOOC, 2018</li>
        <li><strong>Harvard University</strong>, CS50x: Introduction to Computer Science, 2017</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Languages</h2>
      <p>Finnish (native), English (fluent), Spanish (basic).</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="side" aria-label="Skills and contact">
      {
        skills.map((s) => (
          <div>
            <h2>{s.group}</h2>
            <ul class="chips">{s.items.map((i) => <li>{i}</li>)}</ul>
          </div>
        ))
      }
      <div class="contact">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>The quickest way is email.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:santtu.nykanen@gmail.com">Email me</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-block: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px) 48px;
  }
  .text {
    flex: 1 1 480px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px);
  }
  .lede {
    max-width: 620px;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .portrait {
    width: clamp(160px, 24vw, 280px);
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    clip-path: polygon(22% 0, 78% 0, 100% 22%, 100% 78%, 78% 100%, 22% 100%, 0 78%, 0 22%);
    background: var(--saffron);
  }
  .cols {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 48px 72px;
    padding-bottom: 96px;
  }
  .cols .prose {
    flex: 999 1 560px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
  }
  .side {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .side h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
  }
  .contact h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
</style>
